        "# ML-07 — Baseline Action Score and Top-20 Review\n",
      ],
      "id": "HuDs0XWCiLOL"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "EBx_O6tpiLOO"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 1. My rule and its reason codes\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "**The rule, in plain words:** a page is worth flagging for review if it is **stale** (created\n",
        "long ago, not fresh) **and** its clicks are **underperforming what its search position should\n",
        "earn** — the same staleness idea behind FlyRank's refresh flags, and the same CTR-vs-position\n",
        "gap behind the CTR-fix logic, combined into one score.\n",
        "\n",
        "Before encoding it, I check both signals against the real April outcome to make sure they're\n",
        "worth building on — not assuming it, checking it.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Signal 1 — Staleness → linked to the refresh flags.** Bucket `content_age_days_march` into\n",
        "quartiles and compare the actual April decline rate across buckets, with `n` shown for each."
      ],
      "id": "EBx_O6tpiLOO"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 101,
          "referenced_widgets": [
            "8fe6a367404446c5893b30afd733fc55",
            "bab838ba1bd444bc8523678e3b4439e9",
            "b08a828ab5664625a9a8461e6752d83d"
          ]
        },
        "id": "YSzJgY1miLOP",
        "outputId": "893de6c2-921c-445b-9500-16712427f157"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Paste your Hugging Face READ token (hf_...): ··········\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "FloatProgress(value=0.0, layout=Layout(width='auto'), style=ProgressStyle(bar_color='black'))"
            ],
            "application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json": {
              "version_major": 2,
